@host = http://localhost:5298
@token = paste-development-access-token-here
@walletId = paste-created-wallet-id-here

### Development only: copy accessToken from the response into @token
POST {{host}}/dev/token

### Use a new customer ID when repeating wallet creation
POST {{host}}/api/wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId":"http-demo-customer"}

###
GET {{host}}/api/wallets/{{walletId}}/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{host}}/api/wallets/{{walletId}}/credits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"amountKobo":10000000}

###
GET {{host}}/api/wallets/{{walletId}}/statement?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
